  id: act2.redthread
  displayName: A Red Thread
  description: Sigrun, Eirik's sister, sewed a red thread into his coat before he left, so he could find his way home. Troll Valley's old camps keep things the snow takes. Find her thread at a snowed-in camp, bring it home, and set it before the portal.
  chain: Eirik
  journalNotes: The red thread is at a camp half under the snow in Troll Valley. Set before the portal, it might open a window to whoever sewed it.
